    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "2. 求齐次线性方程组 $\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}&2x_{1}-x_{2}+x_{3}+x_{4}=0\\\\ &x_{1}+2x_{2}-x_{3}+4x_{4}=0\\\\ &x_{1}+7x_{2}-4x_{3}+11x_{4}=0\\\\ &5x_{1}+5x_{2}-2x_{3}+13x_{4}=0\\end{aligned}\\right.$ 的基础解系与通解.",
